WEBVTT

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.900
It started from a small village.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:24.220
One day, along with a small crowd, a man appeared from the bottom of the underground cemetery.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:29.490
The man was the king of the Golden Land, which had been destroyed 1,000 years ago.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.860
A country that once was proud of its beauty is now trapped by a violent magician.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:44.040
Give everything to the one who defeated the magician.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:49.200
When he said that, the man became dust and disappeared.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:12.940
You can do it! If you defeat this dragon, you'll only have one life left!

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:13.990
