00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:03.980
There was no top or bottom, but the food was just a special privilege.

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:06.750
Dungeon Meal

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.110
Ah, Dungeon Meal

00:24:30.670 --> 00:24:32.870
When several normalities overlap,

00:24:34.010 --> 00:24:37.880
there's magic lurking at the bottom of time.

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:41.070
The answer is probably the devil.

00:24:41.470 --> 00:24:44.170
In a dream that can't be woken up from a dream,

